ight: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603130155146562_720.jpg" alt="" src="http://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603130155146562_720.jpg"> </div><p><strong>【战报新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/match1931842date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">维拉客场1-0里尔占据晋级先机 沃特金斯头球吊射破门+失单刀</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260313/zhanbao_image_1931842_1773343169_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260313/zhanbao_image_1931842_1773343169_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260313/zhanbao_image_1931842_1773343169_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>沃特金斯头球破门，维拉客场1-0战胜里尔。两队次回合交手将是在北京时间3月20日凌晨4:00，维拉在主场迎战里尔。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/match1931840date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">诺丁汉森林0-1中日德兰失先机 森林22射6正0进球曹圭成头槌制胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260313/zhanbao_image_1931840_1773352210_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1