3/match1931841date2026vnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">3场不胜！罗马首回合1-1博洛尼亚 佩莱格里尼替补救主马伦两中柱</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.75" data="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260313/zhanbao_image_1931841_1773343403_gray.jpeg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.75" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.75" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260313/zhanbao_image_1931841_1773343403_gray.jpeg" alt="" src="https://bbsimg.duoduocdn.com/bbsimg/shot/images/share_match_image/20260313/zhanbao_image_1931841_1773343403_gray.jpeg"> </div><p>佩莱格里尼替补救主，马伦两次中柱，罗马客场1-1战平博洛尼亚，双方将于3月20日移师罗马奥林匹克球场进行次回合较量。</p><p><strong>【热点新闻】</strong></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/69b31734d2fb6native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">险些团灭！英超9队参加欧战1/8决赛首回合8队不胜，仅维拉1球小胜</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603130343199013.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603130343199013_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603130343199013_720.jpg"> </div><p>欧战1/8决赛首回合比赛结束，英超9队出战仅维拉取胜。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/69b339d2cdc3anative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">爆冷！诺丁汉森林阵容身价5.68亿欧，不敌身价9900万欧中日德兰</a></p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-12/69b2c6f7b24a3native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">特朗普：欢迎伊朗参加世界杯，但为了生命安全不建议他们参加</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.53" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251206/69331b37ca3ca.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.53" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.53" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251206/69331b37ca3ca.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251206/69331b37ca3ca.jpg"> </div><p>美国总统特朗普在社媒发文，发表了自己对伊朗国家队参加世界杯的看法。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/69b3054bb4296native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">邮报：曼城更衣室赛后一片沉寂、没人说话，球员洗澡都提不起劲</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260121/696fd9fb43a42_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260121/696fd9fb43a42_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260121/696fd9fb43a42_720.jpg"> </div><p>欧冠1/8决赛首回合，曼城客场0-3惨败皇马，《邮报》披露了曼城更衣室赛后情况。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/69b306f176db8native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">非常不满！都体解读多纳鲁马对裁判唇语：装什么装？凭啥给黄牌？</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="2" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603130236364398_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="2" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="2" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603130236364398_720.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260313/202603130236364398_720.jpg"> </div><p>《都灵体育报》解读了被判罚黄点套餐后，曼城门将多纳鲁马在争辩时对裁判所说的话。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/69b2f0d5c4babnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">记者：皇马愿出售卡马文加要价不低于5000万欧，英超多队有意</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68de6780d0bd6.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68de6780d0bd6.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_251002/68de6780d0bd6.jpg"> </div><p>记者莫雷托消息，皇马愿听取对卡马文加的报价，多家英超球队有意。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-12/69b2d31b2d141native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">巴萨将强挖哈兰德？经纪人否认：哈兰德和团队都没进行过任何接触</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260108/695ed58c10dc1_1280.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260108/695ed58c10dc1.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260108/695ed58c10dc1.jpg"> </div><p>哈兰德的经纪人拉法埃拉·皮门塔近日公开发声，坚决否认有关巴萨主席竞选团队与其进行接触的传闻。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-12/69b2d732b1e2dnative.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">饱受伤病困扰，德转预热贝林厄姆身价将下跌：最低跌至1.3亿欧</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260312/202603122309469761.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="0.8" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260312/202603122309469761.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260312/202603122309469761.jpg"> </div><p>德转将在近期更新西甲球员身价，并预热皇马中场贝林厄姆身价将会下跌。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/69b2e2f9e99f1native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">马卡报：皇马9人无法出战埃尔切，10人对阵曼城后体力透支</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="1.5" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260118/696cd0ae652f5.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="1.5" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加载图片</div>     <img style="max-width: 100%; width: 100%; display: inline; height: 100%;" data-ratio="1.5" forbiden_android=">" t-rc="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260118/696cd0ae652f5.jpg" alt="" src="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/day_260118/696cd0ae652f5.jpg"> </div><p>据《马卡报》报道，本周末对阵埃尔切的西甲比赛，皇马将有9名球员因伤病或停赛缺阵，另外10名球员在对阵曼城后体力透支。</p><p><a href="https://news.zhibo8.cc/zuqiu/2026-03-13/69b2e59d19929native.htm" target="_blank" weibo="" mode="1,2">欧冠周最佳阵：K77、小蜘蛛、奥利塞进攻三叉戟，巴尔韦德在列</a></p><div class="img_wrap" data-ratio="0.8" data="https://tu.duoduocdn.com/uploads/news/day_260313/202603130016209844.jpg" data-thumb="" img_op="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" img_op_new="1_x|1_x|1_x|1_x" type="IMG" style="background-size: 100% 100%; width: 300px; height: 200px; margin: 0 auto; text-align: center; position: relative;">     <div class="play_btn" data-ratio="0.8" style="width: 100%; height: 200px; background: #eeeeee; line-height: 200px;  font-size: 1em;text-indent:-9999px;color: #A7A2A2; position: absolute;z-index: 2;">点击加